C VERCHP    SOURCE    CB215821  20/11/25    13:42:21     10792          
*  verification chpoint
*
      subroutine verchp(mchpoi,resul)
      implicit real*8 (a-h,o-z)
      logical resul

-INC PPARAM
-INC CCOPTIO
-INC CCREEL
-INC SMCHPOI
*
      resul = .true.

      do ip = 1,ipchp(/1)
       msoupo=ipchp(ip)
       mpoval=ipoval
       do j=1,vpocha(/2)
        do i=1,vpocha(/1)
          xval=vpocha(i,j)

         if (.not.(xval.le.xgrand.and.xval.ge.-xgrand))
     >      resul = .false.
        enddo
       enddo
      enddo
      end

 
 
